(7619884, 1234252, 98565, '<td valign="top">I thought I would like pictures of a person more for this challenge but I have to revise my opinion: this is really Wonderful. Choice of motif and pp make it like an original from 1830</td>', 'I thought I would like pictures of a person more for this challenge but I have to revise my opinion: this is really Wonderful. Choice of motif and pp make it like an original from 1830', '2019-03-15 15:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7619885, 1234133, 98565, '<td valign="top">this is a self-portrait isn''t it? These are so hard to control imo...buit you did a Wonderful Job. You, all the items in the bg and your pp send me on a time travel</td>', 'this is a self-portrait isn''t it? These are so hard to control imo...buit you did a Wonderful Job. You, all the items in the bg and your pp send me on a time travel', '2019-03-15 15:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7619944, 1234227, 61651, '<td valign="top">Excellent job evoking the daguerreotype portrait aesthetic - if I had a quibble, I''d say it would have been good to use a reflector on the sitter''s right side to open up the shadows a bit on that side of his face and bring out more detail in the scarf on that side too.</td>', 'Excellent job evoking the daguerreotype portrait aesthetic - if I had a quibble, I''d say it would have been good to use a reflector on the sitter''s right side to open up the shadows a bit on that side of his face and bring out more detail in the scarf on that side too.', '2019-03-15 18:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7620015, 1234116, 114285, '<td valign="top">One of the better ones for sure.</td>', 'One of the better ones for sure.', '2019-03-16 07:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7620055, 1233964, 124815, '<td valign="top">Eliza looks deep inside and I wish she''ll impart with us some of the things she sees. Everything about her is in perfect harmony but impenetrable. A beautiful enigma.</td>', 'Eliza looks deep inside and I wish she''ll impart with us some of the things she sees. Everything about her is in perfect harmony but impenetrable. A beautiful enigma.', '2019-03-16 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
